  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-08-14T19:41:04.650Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please allow people to completely disable/hide the picture that appears above their head next to their name. In the past it used to be the first three letters of the user's name by default that expanded out as you got closer. The option to use this was removed and now we're forced with an image of either the avatar upload thumbnail or something we upload ourselves.\n\nI'm a very simple guy with a very simple three letter name. The picture is almost as big as my name. It looks tacky with a forced image that I never wanted. No amount of bling or purchasable content will make it look good. I feel bad for the users who claimed two or even one character names.\n\nPlease allow us to go back to being modest. Not everyone wants to look ultra fancy.",
